17:39:41","reviewer_itemname":"@brooklynjew"},{"reviewtitle":"Old Alien Invasion Movie","reviewbody":"Great film.  Reminded me of the Thing from Another World 1951.  Great dialogue.  I love these old movies.  ","stars":"5","reviewer":"AngelMatrix77","reviewdate":"2024-03-09 14:24:59","createdate":"2024-03-09 14:24:59","reviewer_itemname":"@angelmatrix77"},{"reviewtitle":"What a waste !!!","reviewbody":"A 5.6G file at .m4v encoding?!? WHY ?!? You are wasting valuable bandwidth !!! Zero stars rating for this upload as it is prohibiting to most with a capped/limited ISP service.","stars":"1","reviewer":"AYTONOHTON","reviewdate":"2025-01-12 12:39:23","createdate":"2025-01-12 12:39:23","reviewer_itemname":"@aytonohton"},{"reviewtitle":"IMPRESSIVE & CREEPY, SCIENCE-FICTION SUBMISSION","reviewbody":"THE QUATERMASS XPERIMENT (THE CREEPING UNKNOWN) is an outstanding, stylish, Hammer adaptation from Val Guest and Nigel Kneale. Brian Donlevy\u2019s petulant Quatermass actually works better than one might expect, giving the tension an extra, time-is-of-the-essence edge. Richard Wordsworth is also remarkable as the anguished astronaut. One can feel his pain and desperation. His scene with the girl and her doll is quite poignant. (As a side note, the story plays in tune with Robert Day/John Croydon's FIRST MAN INTO SPACE, and one can see the influence the picture had on William Sach's THE INCREDIBLE MELTING MAN, Peter Hyams/Douglas Preston/Lincoln Child's THE RELIC and Panos Cosmatos/Aaron Stewart-Ahn/Guillermo del Toro's CABINET OF CURIOSITIES episode, \u201cThe Viewing.\u201d)","stars":"0","reviewer":"MichaelHousel","reviewdate":"2025-05-27 23:31:02","createdate":"2025-05-27 21:55:07","reviewer_itemname":"@michaelhousel"},{"reviewtitle":"Thank you","reviewbody":"Good picture quality. Classic sci-fi story.","stars":"5","reviewer":"Panna Kinder","reviewdate":"2025-08-06 22:19:03","createdate":"2025-08-06 22:19:03","reviewer_itemname":"@panna_kinder"}],"server":"dn800305.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn800305":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5430404968"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-06-11 10:24:57.941724"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":390173117,"workable_servers":["dn800305.us.archive.org"]}